    "voicelines": [
        {
            "type": "card_get",
            "text": "Ready to drown in romance tonight? Of course you are, right?",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_dial_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_myself.acb/vo_live_dial_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_myself.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "situation",
            "text": "Bang bang! Hehe, successful headshot!\nWere you gazing at fireworks? You left yourself wide open.\nWho would've thought the water blaster target practice would come in handy so soon?\n...How long do you plan on crawling around down there?\nDo you maybe wanna go swimming at the night pool?\nHehe, no problem to have quirky tastes, but aren’t you missing the point of how to enjoy this place?\nFine, I suppose I have no choice but give you a special lesson. Now, let's make this a night to remember~♪",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_situation.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_situation.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "skill",
            "text": "I’ll sign my name with a water blaster!♪",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_cmn_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_skill-card.acb/vo_live_cmn_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_skill-card.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_1",
            "text": "You don’t need to ask if sunglasses are necessary at night. They’re total nonsense! Of course not, they’re not.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-001.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-001.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_2",
            "text": "The night pool is great because you won’t get attacked by a laser weapon. Oh, I mean sunlight.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-002.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-002.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_3",
            "text": "Both people and insects are drawn to magical lights.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-003.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-003.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_4",
            "text": "*gasp* Splashing water on a maiden is prison worthy!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-004.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-004.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_5",
            "text": "Everyone comes here seeking a special time. It was special, for me especially.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-005.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0083-00_potential-005.mp3"
        }
    ],
